WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.785
The king never forgot my refusal to take the rest of the Blefuscan ships.

2
00:00:05.786 --> 00:00:12.720
I had prevented the Blefuscans from attacking Lilliput, but he was still angry with me.

3
00:00:12.721 --> 00:00:16.352
Some of the king’s men agreed with my decision.

4
00:00:16.353 --> 00:00:20.464
"You did the right thing," one of them told me.Not

5
00:00:20.465 --> 00:00:24.565
everyone, however, felt the same way. "You

6
00:00:24.566 --> 00:00:29.965
are a traitor," another of the king’s advisers growled at me. Through

7
00:00:29.966 --> 00:00:35.399
my friends in the palace, I heard that I now had some secret enemies. From

8
00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:40.111
then on, they and the king were against me. About

9
00:00:40.112 --> 00:00:42.564
three weeks passed. One

10
00:00:42.565 --> 00:00:49.161
day, the Blefuscan king sent six of his officials to Lilliput to speak for him. The

11
00:00:49.162 --> 00:00:53.045
officials had a long meeting with the Lilliputian king. Because

12
00:00:53.046 --> 00:00:58.300
I was still one of his chief officials, I was at the meeting. "Your

13
00:00:58.301 --> 00:01:06.039
Majesty," said the chief official from Blefuscu, "our king would like to make peace with you. Blefuscu

14
00:01:06.040 --> 00:01:10.115
and Lilliput have been at war for too long. Many

15
00:01:10.116 --> 00:01:13.504
of our people have died or been hurt." "It

16
00:01:13.505 --> 00:01:18.930
has been a long war," sighed the king. He

17
00:01:18.931 --> 00:01:24.746
and the visiting officials discussed how their countries could get along without fighting. The

18
00:01:24.747 --> 00:01:30.058
king of Lilliput wanted the king of Blefuscu to agree to certain conditions. After

19
00:01:30.059 --> 00:01:35.314
hours of discussion, the two sides reached an agreement. "I

20
00:01:35.315 --> 00:01:38.455
accept your king’s peace offer," the

21
00:01:38.456 --> 00:01:41.025
king of Lilliput said finally. "Tell

22
00:01:41.026 --> 00:01:45.573
him that I will have my chief official write up an agreement. Then

23
00:01:45.574 --> 00:01:48.373
your king and I will sign it." I

24
00:01:48.374 --> 00:01:52.884
was surprised but happy to hear Lilliput’s king say this. The

25
00:01:52.885 --> 00:01:56.392
two countries would no longer be at war. The

26
00:01:56.393 --> 00:02:00.600
next day, the Blefuscan officials came to see me.

27
00:02:00.601 --> 00:02:06.761
"Our king has heard of your refusal to take the rest of his ships," the chief official said.

28
00:02:06.762 --> 00:02:08.811
"He asked me to thank you.

29
00:02:08.812 --> 00:02:11.373
He thinks you are a generous giant.

30
00:02:11.374 --> 00:02:15.357
He invites you to come to Blefuscu for a visit."

31
00:02:15.358 --> 00:02:20.764
"I would be delighted to travel to Blefuscu and meet your king," I replied.

32
00:02:20.765 --> 00:02:24.515
"I will ask the king of Lilliput for his permission to visit soon."

33
00:02:24.516 --> 00:02:29.141
The Blefuscans were no longer angry with me for taking their ships.

34
00:02:29.142 --> 00:02:33.538
I was happy that they were ready to forgive and forget.

35
00:02:33.539 --> 00:02:36.306
Our meeting continued for a few hours.

36
00:02:36.307 --> 00:02:39.764
The Blefuscan officials were curious about me.

37
00:02:39.765 --> 00:02:44.966
They had never met a giant before, and they asked me many questions.

38
00:02:44.967 --> 00:02:50.283
"Would you do something to show us how strong you are?" one asked.

39
00:02:50.284 --> 00:02:53.031
"Of course," I replied.

40
00:02:53.032 --> 00:02:56.558
Just outside my house was a large rock.

41
00:02:56.559 --> 00:03:00.063
It was much bigger than the tiny Blefuscans.

42
00:03:00.064 --> 00:03:02.925
I picked it up with both my hands.

43
00:03:02.926 --> 00:03:05.290
Even for me it was quite heavy.

44
00:03:05.291 --> 00:03:10.081
I threw it into an empty field as the Blefuscans watched.

45
00:03:10.082 --> 00:03:15.071
"Your strength is amazing!" the chief official exclaimed.

46
00:03:15.072 --> 00:03:19.103
When the visit ended, he repeated his invitation.

47
00:03:19.104 --> 00:03:23.449
"Come to visit us soon in Blefuscu," he said.

48
00:03:23.450 --> 00:03:27.173
"I will give a good report of you to our king."

49
00:03:27.174 --> 00:03:31.842
A few days later, I had a chance to speak to the king of Lilliput.

50
00:03:31.843 --> 00:03:34.500
"Your Majesty," I said.

51
00:03:34.501 --> 00:03:37.745
"The king of Blefuscu has invited me to visit his island.

52
00:03:37.746 --> 00:03:39.136
I would like to go.

53
00:03:39.137 --> 00:03:41.859
May I have your permission, please?"

54
00:03:41.860 --> 00:03:47.795
"Yes," the king replied, although his manner was quite cold.

55
00:03:47.796 --> 00:03:49.984
"You may visit Blefuscu.

56
00:03:49.985 --> 00:03:56.574
But let me know before you leave Lilliput."

